+## Instant-open balance and refresh
+
+Available shows the selected account's full deposited, unallocated balance.
+Fees, slippage and leverage never reduce the displayed figure. Max carries the
+raw 18-decimal balance into the SDK budget; a partial $100 input also includes
+opening fees. The SDK sizes quantity inside that budget. Estimates and their
+timestamps are forwarded from preparation to submission.
+
+The form refreshes its existing balance query after every submission attempt.
+Acceptance keeps the position pending. Open and failure socket events refresh
+the actual displayed balance key as well as position and VA reads; existing
+polling remains the fallback. Failed reads keep the last successful value, and
+an initial unavailable balance is shown as unknown.
diff --git a/docs/handbook/tech-debt/vibecaps-vibe-dock-sizing.md b/docs/handbook/tech-debt/vibecaps-vibe-dock-sizing.md
index db38fb9..c77175d 100644
--- a/docs/handbook/tech-debt/vibecaps-vibe-dock-sizing.md
