 - Delete old files during migration instead of leaving compatibility re-exports.
 - Never report an open-time TP/SL as set from a submission result alone. COH accepting the request is not the order existing, and COH's order search has been seen lagging minutes behind a leg that was created fine. Observe the leg before the success toast; anything else is reported as pending. Never infer failure from a timer — the only failure signal is COH's own rejection report.
+
+## Instant-open ownership
+
+The SDK prepares and submits the trade. The form owns input state, pending rows,
+notifications and the TP/SL handoff. Amount is a fee-inclusive funding budget;
+Available and Max use the full unallocated balance without local fee deductions.
+Opening fees, funding, signed quantity and price bounds come from the SDK.
